sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Recruiter / Visitor
    participant NextJS as Next.js Chatbot UI
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI (/api/v1/chat)
    participant Agent as LangGraph / Heuristic Agent
    participant Gemini as Google Gemini API
    participant Knowledge as Meraj Resume & Project Vector DB

    User->>NextJS: Enters question ("Tell me about Meraj's agentic code reviewer")
    NextJS->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/chat { message, history }
    FastAPI->>Agent: Query Analysis & Context Injection
    Agent->>Knowledge: Retrieve Meraj's Project & Experience Data
    Knowledge-->>Agent: Relevant Tech Specs & Accomplishments
    alt Gemini API Key Available
        Agent->>Gemini: Prompt with System Guardrails & Injected Knowledge
        Gemini-->>Agent: Structured Markdown Answer
    else Local Heuristic Fallback
        Agent-->>Agent: Evaluate Query Intent (Skills, Projects, Education, Contact)
        Agent-->>Agent: Synthesize Rich Contextual Answer
    end
    Agent-->>FastAPI: Formatted Answer + Follow-up Suggestions
    FastAPI-->>NextJS: 200 OK { response, suggested_prompts }
    NextJS->>User: Renders Glassmorphic Chat Bubble with dynamic typing
